    "data_availability": "The calendar is shared with the partner; childcare messages remain in the provider app.",
    "integration_and_approval_constraints": "A reminder may be drafted automatically, but a parent confirms any escort change; handover remains in person."
  },
  "interpretation": "Activity dependencies describe the nominal sequence. Decision branches and exception descriptions qualify that sequence; this is not an executable BPMN model."
